	(text_box "Raspberry Pi\nConnecting the UART pins on the RPi to make a UPDI for programming the ATtiny1616\nSetup the UART on the RPI by running `sudo rpi-config` -> `3 Interface Options` -> `I6 Serial Port` -> `Would you like a login shell to be accessible over serial?: <NO>` -> `Would you like the serial port hardware to be enabled? <YES>` "
