	)
	(text_box "Buttons:\n- Press Button once, shows the parameters that it will be programmed with. \n- Press same button to program.\n- Press different button for different program.\n\nHow to change default parameters:\n- Plug in USB drive (FAT32) with a JSON file that has the default values that should be used.\n- Have the unique ID for the battery auto increment."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
